   - 期初 (opening), 期间增加合计 (non-negative), 期间减少合计 (non-negative), 净变动 (net), 期末 (closing).
   - 期初 + 增加 - 减少 = 期末.
   - 按业务类型及是否冲销分别列出带符号的净变动小计 (subtotals by business type × reversal flag, signed net).
   - 调拨按各仓实际方向统计 (transfer counted per warehouse direction).
   - 到货、退货及反向冲销计入实存 (arrival, return, and their reversals count); 采购登记、取消及其冲销不计入 (po/cancel/cancel-rev don't count — they have no entries anyway).
